WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.840
Space Explorer started as an easter egg for my apps,

2
00:00:03.840 --> 00:00:06.840
in this case, SoundShaper.

3
00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:09.320
You'd go to a specific part of the app,

4
00:00:09.320 --> 00:00:14.060
tap a certain combination, and Space Explorer would open

5
00:00:14.060 --> 00:00:15.740
as a game.

6
00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:18.180
It was going to have several levels,

7
00:00:18.180 --> 00:00:21.940
like in the sea, in space, in a space war,

8
00:00:21.940 --> 00:00:26.700
but I took it out to keep SoundShaper simple.

9
00:00:26.700 --> 00:00:30.330
Months later, we applied to a Platanus Hackathon that

10
00:00:30.330 --> 00:00:35.460
had an arcade challenge, which was make a video game.

11
00:00:35.460 --> 00:00:38.530
So I already had the idea ready,

12
00:00:38.530 --> 00:00:42.200
so I used it to apply.

13
00:00:42.200 --> 00:00:46.120
Space Explorer is a 3D space shooter that fits in 50

14
00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:50.030
kilobytes, not megabytes, and honestly,

15
00:00:50.030 --> 00:00:52.760
it came out pretty cool.

16
00:00:52.760 --> 00:00:58.820
You can play it right here on Platanus official site.

17
00:00:58.820 --> 00:01:02.360
I don't know if it was the best game technically,

18
00:01:02.360 --> 00:01:05.960
because by popular vote, it wasn't,

19
00:01:05.960 --> 00:01:09.740
but I think it's still a super cool game,

20
00:01:09.740 --> 00:01:12.058
and I'm pretty happy with it.
